# 一般資訊

[Pufferfish's Skills](https://modrinth.com/mod/skills) 的附加元件

包含對以下模組的支援：
- [Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks](https://modrinth.com/mod/irons-spells-n-spellbooks)

建議查閱文件：
- https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes
- https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/operations/operation

---

屬性系統已移至
[Additional Attributes](https://modrinth.com/mod/additional-attributes)

# 經驗值來源

## 收割農作物

掛接到從戰利品表獲取物品的方法

**可用操作**：

- `player`：收割農作物的玩家（原型為[玩家](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-player)）
- `block`：被收割的方塊（原型為[方塊狀態](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-block-state)）
- `tool`：使用的工具（原型為[物品堆疊](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-item-stack)）
- `dropped_seeds`：基於 `#forge:seeds` 標籤掉落的種子數量（原型為 `number`）
- `dropped_crops`：基於 `#forge:crops` 標籤掉落的作物數量（原型為 `number`）

範例：

```json
{
  "type": "pufferfish_unofficial_additions:harvest_crops",
  "data": {
    "variables": {
      "crops": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "block"
          },
          {
            "type": "puffish_skills:test",
            "data": {
              "block": "#minecraft:crops"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "dropped_crops": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "dropped_crops"
          }
        ]
      },
      "dropped_seeds": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "dropped_seeds"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "experience": [
      {
        "condition": "crops",
        "expression": "dropped_crops + (dropped_seeds * 0.2)"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

## 釣魚經驗值

每個釣到的物品都會觸發

**可用操作**：

- `player`：釣魚的玩家（原型為[玩家](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-player)）
- `tool`：使用的工具（原型為[物品堆疊](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-item-stack)）
- `fished`：釣到的物品（原型為[物品堆疊](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-item-stack)）

範例：

```json
    {
  "type": "pufferfish_unofficial_additions:fishing",
  "data": {
    "variables": {
      "fishes": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "fished"
          },
          {
            "type": "puffish_skills:test",
            "data": {
              "item": "#minecraft:fishes"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "fished_amount": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "fished"
          },
          {
            "type": "count"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "experience": [
      {
        "condition": "fishes",
        "expression": "fished_amount * 4"
      },
      {
        "condition": "!fishes",
        "expression": "fished_amount * 2"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

# 獎勵

## 效果
施加效果（無限持續時間）：
- 在從定義中移除獎勵之前，需要重置技能（或手動移除效果）

```json
{
  "type": "pufferfish_unofficial_additions:effect",
  "data": {
    "effect": "minecraft:regeneration",
    "amplifier": 0,
    "type": "GRANT"
  }
}
```

授予對特定等級以下效果的免疫：

```json
{
  "type": "pufferfish_unofficial_additions:effect",
  "data": {
    "effect": "minecraft:wither",
    "amplifier": 1,
    "type": "IMMUNE"
  }
}
```

修改傳入效果的持續時間和/或等級：
- 如果持續時間因修改而達到 `0`，則效果不會被施加
  - 有效操作為 `+`、`-`、`x` 和 `/`
  - 此元素為可選
- 如果等級因修改而低於 `0`，則效果不會被施加

```json
{
  "type": "pufferfish_unofficial_additions:effect",
  "data": {
    "effect": "minecraft:slowness",
    "amplifier": -2,
    "duration_modification": "/2.5",
    "type": "MODIFY"
  }
}
```

## 可行走細雪

允許在細雪上行走

```json
{
  "type": "puffish_skills:tag",
  "data": {
    "tag": "walk_on_powder_snow"
  }
}
```

# Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks

## 經驗值來源

新增施放法術的經驗值來源

**注意**：經驗值來源會在每個法術刻觸發，意味著持續性法術可能觸發多次（請參閱 `expected_ticks` 參數）

**可用操作**：

- `player`：施法者（原型為[玩家](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-player)）
- `main_hand`：主手持有的物品（原型為[物品堆疊](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-item-stack)）
- `spellbook`：當前裝備的法術書（原型為[物品堆疊](https://puffish.net/skillsmod/docs/creators/configuration/calculations/prototypes#minecraft-item-stack)）
- `school`：法術的學派類型（原型為自訂類型）
    - 值由 `school` 定義
- `spell`：法術（原型為自訂類型）
    - 值由 `spell` 定義
    - 包含以下子操作：
        - `min_level`：此類法術的最低等級（原型為 `number`）
        - `max_level`：此類法術的最高等級（原型為 `number`）
        - `cast_type`：法術的施放方式（`INSTANT`、`LONG`、`CONTINUOUS`）（原型為自訂類型）
          - 值由 `value` 定義
- `level`：法術的等級（包含透過物品等的修改）（原型為 `number`）
- `min_level_rarity`：基於稀有度的法術最低等級（原型為 `number`）
- `rarity_name`：稀有度名稱（`COMMON`、`RARE`、`EPIC`、`LEGENDARY`）（原型為自訂類型）
    - 值由 `value` 定義
- `rarity`：稀有度的序數（`0` 為 `COMMON`，`4` 為 `LEGENDARY`）（原型為 `number`）
- `mana_cost`：該等級法術的法力消耗（如果施放消耗法力）（原型為 `number`）
- `mana_cost_per_second`：僅對持續性法術設定（且如果施放消耗法力）（原型為 `number`）
- `cast_duration`：持續性法術的持續時間（以秒為單位）（原型為 `number`）
- `cast_charge_time`：法術的充能時間（如果有）（以秒為單位）（原型為 `number`）
- `cooldown`：法術施放後的冷卻時間（以秒為單位）（原型為 `number`）
- `expected_ticks`：瞬發和長詠唱型法術為 `1` - 持續性法術為如果使用完整持續時間的法術刻數量（原型為 `number`）

範例：

```json
    {
  "type": "pufferfish_unofficial_additions:spell_casting",
  "data": {
    "variables": {
      "level": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "level"
          }
        ]
      },
      "rarity": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "rarity_name"
          },
          {
            "type": "puffish_skills:test",
            "data": {
              "value": "LEGENDARY"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "switch",
            "data": {
              "true": 5,
              "false": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "mana_cost": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "mana_cost"
          }
        ]
      },
      "mana_cost_per_second": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "mana_cost_per_second"
          }
        ]
      },
      "spellbook": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "spellbook"
          },
          {
            "type": "puffish_skills:test",
            "data": {
              "item": "irons_spellbooks:iron_spell_book"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "fire_school": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "school"
          },
          {
            "type": "puffish_skills:test",
            "data": {
              "school": "irons_spellbooks:fire"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "blaze_storm": {
        "operations": [
          {
            "type": "spell"
          },
          {
            "type": "puffish_skills:test",
            "data": {
              "spell": "irons_spellbooks:blaze_storm"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "experience": [
      {
        "condition": "spellbook & !blaze_storm & fire_school",
        "expression": "level + (mana_cost / 5) + rarity"
      },
      {
        "condition": "blaze_storm",
        "expression": "(level + (mana_cost_per_second / 10)) / 2"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
